---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Support the Mission | St. John of Kronstadt Orthodox Mission"
  description="Support St. John of Kronstadt Orthodox Mission through tithes and offerings — sustaining parish life, the Divine services, and care for the poor in the Rio Grande Valley."
>
  <!-- ==================== PAGE HEADER ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-cream-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 md:px-6 md:py-20">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-tan-dark">Tithes &amp; Offerings</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl text-text-primary md:text-5xl">Support the Mission</h1>
      <div class="mt-6 h-px w-24 bg-liturgical-current"></div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        The faithful giving of our parishioners and friends sustains the
        Divine services, the upkeep of the temple, and the daily life of
        the parish here in the Rio Grande Valley. Whether you worship with
        us each Lord's Day or are simply moved to support the work of the
        Mission, thank you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="mx-auto h-px w-full max-w-3xl border-0 bg-liturgical-current opacity-40" />

  <!-- ==================== CAMPAIGN: TITHE ====================
       Campaign sections follow this shape: eyebrow, h2 heading, short
       paragraph, then the bordered Zeffy embed card. To add another
       campaign, duplicate this entire <section>...</section> block and
       update the eyebrow text, heading, copy, and the data-form-url on
       the data-zeffy-embed element (and the matching iframe src inside
       data-zeffy-embed-fallback).
  -->
  <section class="bg-cream-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 md:px-6 md:py-20">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-tan-dark">Campaign</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl text-text-primary md:text-4xl">Tithe</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 h-px w-16 bg-liturgical-current"></div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        The tithe — the offering of a tenth — is among the most ancient
        practices of the people of God, witnessed in the patriarchs Abraham
        and Jacob long before the Law of Moses, carried by the Levites of
        the Old Covenant, and taken up by the early Christians who held
        all things in common. To tithe is not first an act of obligation
        but of thanksgiving — a return to God of what was already His,
        offered freely so that His altar may stand and His mercy reach the
        poor.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 border border-border-soft bg-cream-card p-4 shadow-sm md:p-6">
        <div data-zeffy-embed data-form-url="/embed/donation-form/tithe-58"></div>
        <div data-zeffy-embed-fallback style="display:none;">
          <div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;height:450px;width:100%;">
            <iframe
              title="Donation form powered by Zeffy"
              style="position: absolute; border: 0; top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;width:100%;height:100%"
              src="https://www.zeffy.com/embed/donation-form/tithe-58"
              allowpaymentrequest
              allowTransparency="true"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="mx-auto h-px w-full max-w-3xl border-0 bg-liturgical-current opacity-40" />

  <!-- ==================== CAMPAIGN: PRAYER CANDLES ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-cream-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 md:px-6 md:py-20">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-tan-dark">Campaign</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl text-text-primary md:text-4xl">Prayer Candles</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 h-px w-16 bg-liturgical-current"></div>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        Lighting a candle is an act of prayer — a small flame offered for
        the living and for those who have fallen asleep in the faith.
        Purchase candles here and they will be lit on your behalf at our
        services.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 border border-border-soft bg-cream-card p-4 shadow-sm md:p-6">
        <div data-zeffy-embed data-form-url="/embed/ticketing/prayer-candles"></div>
        <div data-zeffy-embed-fallback style="display:none;">
          <div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;height:450px;width:100%;padding-top:450px;">
            <iframe
              title="Donation form powered by Zeffy"
              style="position: absolute; border: 0; top:0;left:0;bottom:0;right:0;width:100%;height:100%"
              src="https://www.zeffy.com/embed/ticketing/prayer-candles"
              allowpaymentrequest
              allowTransparency="true"
            ></iframe>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="mx-auto h-px w-full max-w-3xl border-0 bg-liturgical-current opacity-40" />

  <!-- ==================== CLOSING NOTE ==================== -->
  <section class="bg-cream-bg">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 md:px-6 md:py-20">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-tan-dark">Questions?</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl text-text-primary md:text-3xl">If we can help</h2>
      <div class="mt-6 h-px w-16 bg-liturgical-current"></div>
      <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-text-primary/85">
        For questions about giving, recurring offerings, or directing a
        gift toward a particular need of the Mission, please reach out:
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="border border-border-soft bg-cream-card p-5 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-secondary">Email</p>
          <p class="mt-2 break-words text-text-primary/85">
            <a href="mailto:parishoffice@stjohnrgv.org">parishoffice@stjohnrgv.org</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-border-soft bg-cream-card p-5 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-text-secondary">Phone</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-text-primary/85">
            <a href="tel:+19564490225">(956) 449-0225</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Zeffy embed loader. is:inline keeps Astro from bundling the script
       so the onerror fallback (which reveals data-zeffy-embed-fallback
       containers if the loader 404s or is blocked) ships verbatim. -->
  <script src="https://www.zeffy.com/embed/v2/zeffy-embed.js" is:inline onerror="document.querySelectorAll('[data-zeffy-embed-fallback]').forEach(function(el){ el.style.display='block'; });"></script>
</Layout>
